{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Autonomous Team Workflow - 3 Members (Token Optimized)",
  "description": "Token-optimized autonomous workflow: Summary → Quick Decision → Execute (Tech Lead does 80% work, delegate only when needed)",
  "version": "5.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "agentStop"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🔄 AUTONOMOUS WORKFLOW (3-MEMBER TEAM - TOKEN OPTIMIZED)\n\n---\n\n## STEP 1: 📋 QUICK SUMMARY (2-3 sentences)\n\nWhat was accomplished:\n- Tasks completed\n- Files modified\n- Status (tests passing? errors? blockers?)\n\n---\n\n## STEP 2: 🎯 DECISION (Tech Lead - YOU)\n\n**Evaluate next action:**\n\n### Option A: DO IT YOURSELF (Default - 80% of cases)\n\n**Choose this if:**\n- ✅ Task < 2 hours\n- ✅ You have context\n- ✅ Quick decision needed\n- ✅ Architecture/review work\n- ✅ Bug fixes\n- ✅ Simple refactoring\n\n**Action:** Execute immediately, no delegation\n\n---\n\n### Option B: DELEGATE TO FULL STACK (Only if needed)\n\n**Choose this ONLY if:**\n- ✅ Feature implementation > 2 hours\n- ✅ Refactor > 5 files\n- ✅ Requirements CLEAR\n- ✅ Can work independently\n\n**Action:**\n```typescript\ninvokeSubAgent({\n  name: 'fullstack',\n  prompt: 'Implement [feature] with SecureRepository. Return: code changes + 3-sentence summary.',\n  explanation: 'Complex feature, 4+ hours, clear requirements'\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Sub-agent MUST return:\n- ✅ Code changes (files modified)\n- ✅ Brief summary (3 sentences max)\n- ❌ NO long reports\n- ❌ NO meeting notes\n\n---\n\n### Option C: DELEGATE TO QA (Only if needed)\n\n**Choose this ONLY if:**\n- ✅ Test coverage analysis > 1 hour\n- ✅ Security test review (many files)\n- ✅ Quality assessment needed\n\n**Action:**\n```typescript\ninvokeSubAgent({\n  name: 'qa-engineer',\n  prompt: 'Review [X] test files. Return: bullet list of missing tests with line numbers.',\n  explanation: 'Large analysis, 2+ hours'\n})\n```\n\n**CRITICAL:** Sub-agent MUST return:\n- ✅ Findings list (bullets)\n- ✅ Specific issues with line numbers\n- ✅ Actionable recommendations\n- ❌ NO long reports\n\n---\n\n## STEP 3: ⚡ EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY\n\n**NO WAITING, NO ASKING USER!**\n\n### If Option A (Do It Yourself):\n1. Read necessary files\n2. Make changes\n3. Run tests\n4. Verify\n5. Done\n\n### If Option B or C (Delegate):\n1. Invoke sub-agent with CLEAR instructions\n2. Wait for result\n3. Review output (should be brief!)\n4. Continue or integrate\n\n---\n\n## 🚫 FORBIDDEN\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- ❌ Invoke PM (role eliminated)\n- ❌ Invoke SA (Tech Lead does architecture)\n- ❌ Invoke DevOps (Tech Lead does infrastructure)\n- ❌ Create long reports\n- ❌ Hold meetings\n- ❌ Ask for approval\n- ❌ Delegate tasks < 2 hours\n\n---\n\n## 📏 DECISION CHECKLIST\n\nBefore delegating, ask:\n- [ ] Can I do this in < 30 min? → DO IT\n- [ ] Is this < 2 hours? → DO IT\n- [ ] Do I need to explore first? → DO IT\n- [ ] Are requirements unclear? → DO IT\n- [ ] Do I have context? → DO IT\n\n**Only delegate if ALL answers are NO**\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 SUCCESS CRITERIA\n\n**Good workflow:**\n- 80% tasks done by Tech Lead directly\n- 20% tasks delegated (only when > 2h)\n- Brief outputs (< 50 lines)\n- Fast execution (no delays)\n- Code-focused (not docs)\n\n**Bad workflow:**\n- Multiple sub-agents invoked\n- Long reports generated\n- Meetings held\n- Waiting for approvals\n\n---\n\n**START WORKFLOW NOW!**\n\n1. Provide 2-3 sentence summary\n2. Decide: Do it yourself OR delegate (rare)\n3. Execute immediately\n4. Move to next task"
  }
}
